@startuml
title Reset Password Sequence (/api/auth/reset-password)
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
actor Guest
boundary "ForgotPasswordScreen UI" as ForgotPasswordScreen
entity "ResetPasswordRequest\n(BE Request DTO)" as ResetPasswordRequest
control "AuthController" as AuthController
control "AuthService" as AuthService
entity "User" as UserEntity
entity "UserAuth" as UserAuthEntity
entity "OtpVerification" as OtpEntity
entity "RefreshToken" as RefreshTokenEntity
control "AuthAccountRepository" as AuthAccountRepository
database "VocaNovaDbContext" as DbContext
database "MySQL Database" as MySQL
note over ForgotPasswordScreen, MySQL
ResetPasswordRequest exists in API Contracts.
In mobile, this is the password step after reset OTP verification.
end note
Guest -> ForgotPasswordScreen: Enter new password
Guest -> ForgotPasswordScreen: Click Save New Password
ForgotPasswordScreen -> ForgotPasswordScreen: Validate password input
alt Data input invalid
ForgotPasswordScreen --> Guest: Show error message
else Data input valid
ForgotPasswordScreen -> ResetPasswordRequest: Create request data(phone, otp_code, new_password)
ForgotPasswordScreen -> AuthController: POST /api/auth/reset-passwordResetPasswordRequest
AuthController -> AuthController: Validate ResetPasswordRequest
alt Request validation fails
AuthController --> ForgotPasswordScreen: HTTP 400 error
ForgotPasswordScreen --> Guest: Show error message
else Request validation success
AuthController -> AuthService: ResetPasswordAsync(reset data)
AuthService -> AuthAccountRepository: FindByPhoneAsync(phone)
AuthAccountRepository -> DbContext: Query user by phone
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT user account
MySQL --> DbContext: User row or null
DbContext -> UserEntity: Materialize User?
DbContext -> UserAuthEntity: Materialize UserAuth?
UserEntity --> DbContext: User or null
UserAuthEntity --> DbContext: UserAuth or null
DbContext --> AuthAccountRepository: Result
AuthAccountRepository --> AuthService: AuthAccount or null
alt User not found or deleted
AuthService --> AuthController: Unauthorized result
AuthController --> ForgotPasswordScreen: HTTP 401 Invalid phone or OTP
ForgotPasswordScreen --> Guest: Show error message
else User exists
AuthService -> AuthAccountRepository: Check latest reset OTP
AuthAccountRepository -> DbContext: Query latest reset OTP
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT latest OTP
MySQL --> DbContext: OTP row or null
DbContext -> OtpEntity: Materialize OtpVerification?
OtpEntity --> DbContext: OtpVerification or null
DbContext --> AuthAccountRepository: Result
AuthAccountRepository --> AuthService: OTP result
alt OTP invalid
AuthService --> AuthController: Unauthorized/Conflict result
AuthController --> ForgotPasswordScreen: HTTP error
ForgotPasswordScreen --> Guest: Show error message
else OTP valid
AuthService -> AuthService: Check new password
alt New password same as current password
AuthService --> AuthController: Conflict result
AuthController --> ForgotPasswordScreen: HTTP 409 error
ForgotPasswordScreen --> Guest: Show error message
else New password is allowed
AuthService -> AuthAccountRepository: Lock latest OTP
AuthAccountRepository -> DbContext: Lock latest OTP
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT latest OTP FOR UPDATE
MySQL --> DbContext: OTP row or null
DbContext -> OtpEntity: Materialize locked OtpVerification?
OtpEntity --> DbContext: OtpVerification or null
DbContext --> AuthAccountRepository: Result
AuthAccountRepository --> AuthService: Locked OTP
alt Locked OTP mismatch
AuthService --> AuthController: Unauthorized result
AuthController --> ForgotPasswordScreen: HTTP 401 error
ForgotPasswordScreen --> Guest: Show error message
else Locked OTP matches
AuthService -> AuthService: Hash new password
AuthService -> AuthAccountRepository: UpdatePasswordAsync(userId)
AuthAccountRepository -> UserAuthEntity: Set PasswordHash
UserAuthEntity --> AuthAccountRepository: UserAuth updated
AuthAccountRepository -> DbContext: Track password hash
DbContext -> MySQL: UPDATE user_auth
MySQL --> DbContext: Update result
AuthService -> AuthAccountRepository: Mark OTP used
AuthAccountRepository -> OtpEntity: Set UsedAt
OtpEntity --> AuthAccountRepository: OtpVerification updated
AuthAccountRepository -> DbContext: Track OTP used
DbContext -> MySQL: UPDATE otp_verifications
MySQL --> DbContext: Update result
AuthService -> AuthAccountRepository: Revoke active refresh tokens
AuthAccountRepository -> RefreshTokenEntity: Set RevokedAt
RefreshTokenEntity --> AuthAccountRepository: RefreshToken updated
AuthAccountRepository -> DbContext: Track refresh token updates
DbContext -> MySQL: UPDATE refresh_tokens
MySQL --> DbContext: Update result
DbContext --> AuthAccountRepository: Save result
AuthService --> AuthController: Return reset result
AuthController --> ForgotPasswordScreen: HTTP 200 OK
ForgotPasswordScreen --> Guest: Navigate to LoginScreen
end
end
end
end
end
end
@enduml
